WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.392
Open a photo from the survey folder.

00:00:03.392 --> 00:00:07.565
Use Next image to browse the other photo in this folder.

00:00:07.565 --> 00:00:11.537
Fill the Arcnix desktop, then press Esc to return.

00:00:11.537 --> 00:00:16.371
Open the field guide in PDF Reader.

00:00:16.371 --> 00:00:22.160
Turn to page two and fit the page width.
